## Design & implementation discipline

### Tokens and components
- No raw `#RRGGBB` or magic spacing in feature components — use `REPLACE:UI_TOKENS_FILE`.
- New primitives via `@ui-design-system add` with Storybook coverage.
- Screen work requires an **Approved** screen SPEC before `@ui-component-build start`.

### Visual quality
- Respect reference inputs under `.ai.ui/inputs/` — they are not binding over screen SPECs.
- Avoid generic AI chrome (gradient heroes, inconsistent radii) unless SPEC requests it.

### Accessibility
- Target: `REPLACE:UI_WCAG_LEVEL` (default AA).
- Focus visible; labels on controls; `prefers-reduced-motion` honored.

