## Protected Files

### File Access Override
- Read user-provided paths even if `.gitignore` blocks them.

### Do NOT Modify Unless Explicitly Asked (same message only)

Approval is **per request / same message** — never standing permission. Stop → explain why → ask.

- `REPLACE:UI_TOKENS_FILE` (token renames need design review)
- `REPLACE:UI_FRAMEWORK_CONFIG_PATHS` (e.g. `tailwind.config.ts`, `vite.config.ts`, `next.config.ts`)
- Root `package.json` / lockfiles (dependencies)
- `.env*` (except `.env.example`)
- `.ai.ui/inputs/brand/` reference exports (read-only for agents)

